{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into a challenging adventure that pays tribute to the Game Boy era!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a mysterious place full of secrets and dangers. To escape, you must use your intelligence and strategy to collect keys, unlock doors, and find the exit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Each level presents unique obstacles, requiring quick thinking and precision to overcome challenges like treacherous pits, spikes, hidden traps, and destructible platforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Traps and Pits:</strong> Every step could be fatal\u2014plan your movements wisely.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Strategic Levers:</strong> Unlock new areas and reveal hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>Demo</strong>, play the <strong>first Act of the game</strong>, experience its core mechanics, and immerse yourself in a nostalgic and challenging world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mistake comes at a price, but the feeling of achievement when uncovering the game's secrets makes every moment worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to escape?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346380?t=1740751164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346380?t=1740751164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346380/bd0295fe95d85eee93b8ef1cad07d217d9f59f87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740751164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346380/bd0295fe95d85eee93b8ef1cad07d217d9f59f87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740751164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346380/extras/wishlist-en.gif?t=1740751164\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into a challenging adventure that pays tribute to the Game Boy era!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a mysterious place full of secrets and dangers. To escape, you must use your intelligence and strategy to collect keys, unlock doors, and find the exit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Each level presents unique obstacles, requiring quick thinking and precision to overcome challenges like treacherous pits, spikes, hidden traps, and destructible platforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Traps and Pits:</strong> Every step could be fatal\u2014plan your movements wisely.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Strategic Levers:</strong> Unlock new areas and reveal hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>Demo</strong>, play the <strong>first Act of the game</strong>, experience its core mechanics, and immerse yourself in a nostalgic and challenging world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mistake comes at a price, but the feeling of achievement when uncovering the game's secrets makes every moment worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to escape?</strong></p>","developers":["Ilustra Mundo Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3307350","name":"Condemned: No Escape"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346380/header.jpg?t=1740751164","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"mi